WEBVTT

00:00:04.050 --> 00:00:07.900 line:0 align:center
Widgets lists everything a card can show, grouped by type.

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:14.250 line:0 align:center
Phone widgets come straight from MOTO-HUB on your phone.

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:17.900 line:0 align:center
You can place them anywhere on your dash.

00:00:20.550 --> 00:00:25.700 line:0 align:center
Left panel and Right panel are the widget carousels you set up in the MOTO-HUB app.

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:30.200 line:0 align:center
You choose their content on the phone.

00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:33.100 line:0 align:center
Select a card in the preview.

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:36.950 line:0 align:center
The list shows the styles available for that widget.

00:00:38.050 --> 00:00:43.375 line:0 align:center
Pick a style. The speed, for example, can be Digits, Arc, Dial, Ring or Bubble.

00:00:47.700 --> 00:00:50.300 line:0 align:center
It works the same way for every widget.

00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:56.500 line:0 align:center
An empty preview means the card is too small for that style.

00:00:57.400 --> 00:01:00.400 line:0 align:center
Pick another style, or make the card bigger.

00:01:00.950 --> 00:01:05.075 line:0 align:center
If your dash doesn't have a widget yet, pick it from the list to add it.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:11.575 line:0 align:center
To remove it, go back to Layout and delete its card.

00:01:14.350 --> 00:01:18.825 line:0 align:center
Select a widget, then click its small icon to see what a tap does.

00:01:20.050 --> 00:01:22.400 line:0 align:center
The map handles its own touches.

00:01:22.650 --> 00:01:29.375 line:0 align:center
Turn on Tap to zoom in Widgets, under Map, and a tap zooms to you. Turn it off to drag and pinch the map.

00:01:30.125 --> 00:01:32.675 line:0 align:center
Other widgets let you pick the action.

00:01:33.675 --> 00:01:37.350 line:0 align:center
For example, the weather widget can open your weather app.

00:01:37.800 --> 00:01:41.000 line:0 align:center
A widget can open a phone app, or a sub dash.
